# Keep the Docker build context lean and force a clean in-image build.
# Everything below is regenerated inside the image (npm ci, prisma generate,
# nest build / expo export), so shipping host copies would only risk staleness
# and arch mismatch.
# Exclude node_modules everywhere — both the top-level workspace install and
# nested ones. The host copy is built on OneDrive (Windows-backed) and bleeds
# broken bin-links into the image if shipped, so we force a clean `npm ci`.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.expo
**/.next
**/generated
**/coverage
**/.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm

# Secrets must never enter an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Editor / OS noise
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
